rule ProfitDefinition
	lineageTag: 2972ef19-73c3-5fc4-b017-cfe3b4606713
	statement: Profit (net result) equals Revenue minus Expense within the same scenario and version; Margin equals Profit divided by Revenue. Never add Amount across Revenue and Expense accounts unless the dataset stores expenses as negative values.
	ruleReferencedEntity Account
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty AccountType
	ruleReferencedEntity BudgetLine
		propertyScope: specific
		ruleReferencedProperty Amount
	ruleReferencedRelationship 'Line Posted To Account'
